                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2933"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• 39 trades cost GHS 261 in charges, 2.3% of value traded. Small, frequent buys pay a proportionally high fee.",
